# Keep the serverless bundle small. Vercel prunes ("optimizes") dependencies
# when the bundle exceeds its limit, and that pruning is what broke
# scikit-learn's compiled `_loss` extension at unpickle time -- so trimming
# what ships is a correctness fix here, not just a speed one.
#
# The app only needs: api/, app/, src/, data/*.csv + generate_data.py,
# reports/*.csv + *.json + models/*.joblib.
.git
.github
tests
infra
docs
scripts/make_*
scripts/run_agent_eval.py
scripts/run_anomaly_scan.py
reports/figures
reports/*.jsonl
*.pdf
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
